# Hunter Linux - firmware from Debian's non-free-firmware archive area
#
# These are the packages that make common Intel/AMD/NVIDIA graphics, Wi-Fi,
# Bluetooth and audio hardware work.  They are installed into the image;
# live-build's automatic hardware detection (--firmware-chroot) is disabled
# on purpose because it would only collect firmware for the build machine.
firmware-linux-free
firmware-linux-nonfree
firmware-misc-nonfree
firmware-amd-graphics
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-atheros
firmware-brcm80211
firmware-mediatek
firmware-intel-sound
firmware-sof-signed
